 867+ 7937              ; ==============================================================================
 868+ 7937              ; Visited bitmap helpers — 768 bits = 96 bytes (256 sids × 3 comps)
 869+ 7937              ; ==============================================================================
 870+ 7937              ; Bit index = sid*3 + comp (0..767). Byte = bit_idx / 8. Bit pos = bit_idx % 8.
 871+ 7937              ; bit_idx en 16-bit: HL.
 872+ 7937              ;
 873+ 7937              ; .cmcpMarkVisited     - IN: A=sid, B=comp. Set bit. Destruye AF, BC, HL.
 874+ 7937              ; .cmcpCheckVisitedBC  - IN: B=sid, C=comp. OUT: Z=not visited, NZ=visited.
 875+ 7937              ; ==============================================================================
 876+ 7937              .cmcpMarkVisited:
 877+ 7937                  ; bit_idx = sid*3 + comp; HL = bit_idx
