 493+ 7EB2 28 7F            JR Z, .map3End
 494+ 7EB4 22 A6 7B         LD (MusicPtr), HL
 495+ 7EB7 CD 36 7F         CALL ApplyMusicSpeedShift
 496+ 7EBA 32 A8 7B         LD (MusicTimer), A
