1569+ 952C              .mulHaveGap:
1570+ 952C                  ; --- Cargar side/coord y traducir a pixel (MaiSpawnX/Y) ---
1571+ 952C 3A CB 97         LD A, (MulSlot)
1572+ 952F 5F               LD E, A
