1584+ 9545                  ; --- Reach: bbox del monster (16w × 21h) overlapea con el pixel del gap.
1585+ 9545                  ; Tolerancia segun side (para no sobre-permitir despawn lejos del gap):
1586+ 9545                  ;   N/S (sides 0,1) - gaps son 4 chars de ancho:
1587+ 9545                  ;     X paralelo = 47 px (bbox 16 + gap 32 - 1)
1588+ 9545                  ;     Y perpendicular = 28 px (bbox 21 + gap 8 - 1)
1589+ 9545                  ;   W/E (sides 2,3) - gaps duales: 3 chars superior, 5 chars inferior:
1590+ 9545                  ;     X perpendicular = 23 px (bbox 16 + gap 8 - 1)
1591+ 9545                  ;     Y paralelo = 60 px (bbox 21 + gap 40 - 1, cubre 5 chars worst-case)
1592+ 9545 3A BB 97         LD A, (MaiGapSide)
1593+ 9548 FE 02            CP 2                                        ; MAI_SIDE_W = 2
1594+ 954A 30 1E            JR NC, .mulReachVerticalSide                ; W/E
