 114+ 98F3 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
 115+ 98F6 ED 79            OUT (C), A
 116+ 98F8 ED 7B FD 98      LD SP, (.apbcSavedSP)
 117+ 98FC C9               RET
 118+ 98FD 00 00        .apbcSavedSP: DEFW 0
