2193+ AB02                  ; AABB con margen de 8px (1 celda) por cada lado:
2194+ AB02                  ; playerX < wellX+24 AND wellX-8 < playerX+16
2195+ AB02                  ; playerY < wellY+24 AND wellY-8 < playerY+21
2196+ AB02                  ; --- Check X ---
