2199+ AB07 4F               LD C, A
2200+ AB08 3A 9E 81         LD A, (EntityTable + ENT_POSX)      ; A = playerX
2201+ AB0B B9               CP C                                ; playerX < wellRight+margen?
2202+ AB0C 30 3C            JR NC, .cwNoOverlap                 ; no → fuera
2203+ AB0E 3A 9E 81         LD A, (EntityTable + ENT_POSX)
