2271+ AB6B C8               RET Z
2272+ AB6C 2A 5B 8D         LD HL, (WellCooldownTimer)
2273+ AB6F 7C               LD A, H
2274+ AB70 B5               OR L
2275+ AB71 C8               RET Z
2276+ AB72 CD 78 AB         CALL GetWellBottomOffset
2277+ AB75 C3 92 AB         JP PaintWellWhiteAt
