2292+ AB80 3A 58 8D         LD A, (WellPosX)
2293+ AB83 0F               RRCA
2294+ AB84 0F               RRCA
2295+ AB85 0F               RRCA
2296+ AB86 E6 1F            AND $1F
2297+ AB88 85               ADD A, L
2298+ AB89 6F               LD L, A
