2762+ AE21 DD 7E 03         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSX)
2763+ AE24 FE E8            CP SCREEN_MAX_X
2764+ AE26 30 30            JR NC, .moKbPreOffscreen
2765+ AE28 FE 04            CP MONSTER_KB_SPEED
2766+ AE2A 38 20            JR C, .moKbPreOffscreenMaybeX
