4168+ B622 6F               LD L, A
4169+ B623 26 00            LD H, 0
4170+ B625 29               ADD HL, HL
4171+ B626 29               ADD HL, HL
4172+ B627 29               ADD HL, HL                          ; count × 8 (simplificado)
4173+ B628                  ; Corregir: count × 5 = count × 4 + count
4174+ B628 6F               LD L, A
4175+ B629 26 00            LD H, 0
4176+ B62B 54               LD D, H
4177+ B62C 5D               LD E, L
4178+ B62D 29               ADD HL, HL
