7096+ C693              ; --- ProcessDeath: round-robin de la muerte (no-op si no spawneada) ---
7097+ C693              ; Llamado desde main.asm. Reusa ProcessOneEnemy (que ya tiene branch TYPE_DEATH).
7098+ C693              ProcessDeath:
7099+ C693 3A FA 82         LD A, (DeathSpawned)
7100+ C696 B7               OR A
7101+ C697 C8               RET Z
7102+ C698 DD 21 4B 82      LD IX, EntityTable + (SLOT_DEATH * ENT_SIZE)
7103+ C69C DD 7E 01         LD A, (IX+ENT_TYPE)
7104+ C69F B7               OR A
7105+ C6A0 C8               RET Z
7106+ C6A1 C3 A1 A0         JP ProcessOneEnemy
