7108+ C6A4              ; --- CheckDeathTouchPlayer: AABB completo 24x24 vs player (no margen) ---
7109+ C6A4              ; Si overlap: PlayerHealth=0, erase sprite, despawn.
7110+ C6A4              CheckDeathTouchPlayer:
7111+ C6A4 3A FA 82         LD A, (DeathSpawned)
7112+ C6A7 B7               OR A
