7514+ C901 6F               LD L, A
7515+ C902 30 DD            JR NC, .bivLoop
7516+ C904 24               INC H
7517+ C905 18 DA            JR .bivLoop
7518+ C907              .bivNotFound:
7519+ C907 AF               XOR A                               ; Z
7520+ C908 C9               RET
