7522+ C909              ; --- bfsCanFit: footprint 3x3 de Death en CollisionMap libre? ---
7523+ C909              ; IN: DBfsTryCx, DBfsTryCy. OUT: Z=libre, NZ=bloqueado.
7524+ C909              .bfsCanFit:
7525+ C909 3A 79 5F         LD A, (DBfsTryCy)
7526+ C90C 26 00            LD H, 0
