7528+ C90F 29               ADD HL, HL
7529+ C910 29               ADD HL, HL
7530+ C911 29               ADD HL, HL
7531+ C912 29               ADD HL, HL
7532+ C913 29               ADD HL, HL                          ; HL = cy*32
7533+ C914 3A 78 5F         LD A, (DBfsTryCx)
7534+ C917 85               ADD A, L
7535+ C918 6F               LD L, A
7536+ C919 30 01            JR NC, .cfNoCarry
7537+ C91B 24               INC H
7538+ C91C              .cfNoCarry:
