7547+ C926 B7               OR A
7548+ C927 20 0D            JR NZ, .cfBlocked
7549+ C929 23               INC HL
7550+ C92A 10 F9            DJNZ .cfCol
7551+ C92C E1               POP HL
7552+ C92D 11 20 00         LD DE, 32
7553+ C930 19               ADD HL, DE
7554+ C931 0D               DEC C
