2036+ D74C 4F D4            DEFW BgGfx_forestkey            ; 1: Forest Key
2037+ D74E 8A D4            DEFW BgGfx_ruinskey             ; 2: Ruins Key
2038+ D750 C5 D4            DEFW BgGfx_cemeterykey          ; 3: Cemetery Key
2039+ D752 00 D5            DEFW BgGfx_clock_tower_key      ; 4: ClockTower Key (id 66)
