2359+ D880 3E 03            LD A, PICKUP_FLASH_PERIOD
2360+ D882 32 D3 82         LD (PickupFlashFrames), A
2361+ D885 3A D2 82         LD A, (PickupFlashToggles)
2362+ D888 3D               DEC A
2363+ D889 32 D2 82         LD (PickupFlashToggles), A
