  14+ E2D1 6C E7        CurrentRemapTable:      DEFW RemapTable_CrepT
  15+ E2D3 6C E7        CurrentHouseRemapTable: DEFW RemapTable_CrepT
  16+ E2D5 00           BgSpriteIsHouse:        DEFB 0      ; Flag temporal por sprite
  17+ E2D6 00           BgSpriteSkipRemap:      DEFB 0      ; 1 = ApplyDayCycleRemap retorna sin remap (preserva attrs raw del sprite). Usado por random pickups (life/health/stamina) que deben mantener su brillo siempre.
  18+ E2D7 00           DebugKeyDebounce:       DEFB 0      ; Anti-rebote tecla T
