 426+ E49B CD 4E E6         CALL DrawHudChar
 427+ E49E D1               POP DE
 428+ E49F C1               POP BC
 429+ E4A0 1C               INC E
 430+ E4A1 10 F4            DJNZ .clearLoop
 431+ E4A3
 432+ E4A3                  ; --- CurrentScreenX como 2 digitos decimales en cols 0-1 ---
 433+ E4A3 3A 08 83         LD A, (CurrentScreenX)
 434+ E4A6 1E 00            LD E, 0
 435+ E4A8 CD 06 E5         CALL .drawDec2
