 183+ EB1C              SetClockToPhaseHour:
 184+ EB1C 21 3B E9         LD HL, PhaseStartHour
 185+ EB1F 4F               LD C, A
 186+ EB20 06 00            LD B, 0
 187+ EB22 09               ADD HL, BC
 188+ EB23 7E               LD A, (HL)
