 228+ EB56 38 05            JR C, .minOk
 229+ EB58 D6 05            SUB 5
 230+ EB5A 04               INC B
 231+ EB5B 18 F7            JR .divMin
 232+ EB5D              .minOk:
 233+ EB5D 78               LD A, B
 234+ EB5E 21 50 E9         LD HL, MinHandPtrs
 235+ EB61 CD 4E ED         CALL DrawHandLine
