 174+ EF2A 32 BA 82         LD (PreviousObjectiveDistance), A   ; brujula: primer cruce -> blanco
 175+ EF2D CD B4 75         CALL CancelMagicCompass             ; magic compass normal: cancela al saltar hito
 176+ EF30 CD E1 75         CALL RefreshMagicCompassForNewObjective ; lasting compass: recompute path al nuevo goal
 177+ EF33 C9               RET
 178+ EF34              .cmdkNotPressed:
