 139+ F7C6              ; --- SFX_Attack: "swish" rapido descendente (~60ms) ---
 140+ F7C6              ; Dos pasos: sweep rapido de agudo a grave
 141+ F7C6              SFX_Attack:
 142+ F7C6 28 08 01 00      DEFB 40, 8, 1, 0           ; sweep descendente rapido (agudo → medio)
 143+ F7CA 19 14 02 00      DEFB 25, 20, 2, 0          ; continua bajando (medio → grave)
 144+ F7CE 00               DEFB 0                      ; fin
