1059+ FDF7              ; Player redraw helpers — REUSADOS de town_gate_cutscene.asm (slot 1, always-vis):
1060+ FDF7              ;   TownGateRedrawPlayer:    erase old + draw new (cambio sprite/posicion).
1061+ FDF7              ;   TownGateDrawPlayerHere:  draw + attrs en (ENT_DRAWX, PlayerDrawY).
1062+ FDF7              ;   TownGateErasePlayer:     XOR-erase en (ENT_OLDX, ENT_OLDY) + RestoreOldAttr.
1063+ FDF7              ; Son rutinas puras del estado del player (no tocan ninguna var de town_gate),
